{
  "title": "圆台内接正方形与线面角问题",
  "problem_html": "如图，圆台的下底面圆<span class='t' data-el='circle_bottom'>O</span>的半径为<span class='t' data-el='ln_radius'>$\\sqrt{2}$</span>，<span class='t' data-el='pl_ABCD'>ABCD</span>为圆<span class='t' data-el='circle_bottom'>O</span>的内接正方形。<span class='t' data-el='pt_E'>E</span>,<span class='t' data-el='pt_M'>M</span>为上底面圆<span class='t' data-el='circle_top'>O₁</span>上两点，<span class='t' data-el='pt_F'>F</span>为<span class='t' data-el='ln_BC'>BC</span>的中点，且平面<span class='t' data-el='pl_ABE'>ABE</span>⊥平面<span class='t' data-el='pl_ABCD'>ABCD</span>，<span class='t' data-el='ln_AF'>AF</span>⊥<span class='t' data-el='ln_DE'>DE</span>。<br>（1）求证：<span class='t' data-el='ln_EA'>EA</span> = <span class='t' data-el='ln_EB'>EB</span>；<br>（2）若<span class='t' data-el='ln_OO1'>OO₁=2</span>，直线<span class='t' data-el='ln_FM'>FM</span>与平面<span class='t' data-el='pl_ADE'>ADE</span>所成角正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='ln_sin'>$\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}$</span>，求线段<span class='t' data-el='ln_ME'>ME</span>长度。",
  "questions": [
    {
      "label": "(1)",
      "html": "求证：<span class='t' data-el='ln_EA'>EA</span> = <span class='t' data-el='ln_EB'>EB</span>"
    },
    {
      "label": "(2)",
      "html": "若<span class='t' data-el='ln_OO1'>OO₁=2</span>，直线<span class='t' data-el='ln_FM'>FM</span>与平面<span class='t' data-el='pl_ADE'>ADE</span>所成角正弦值为 <span class='t' data-el='ln_sin'>$\\frac{3\\sqrt{10}}{10}$</span>，求线段<span class='t' data-el='ln_ME'>ME</span>长度"
    }
  ],
